{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/66ea0e90696cd7a61ad6924dbcbec82a.avif?t=1746806716\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Liege Lord needs you! As the days grow shorter, your house and that of your neighbors grow restless. Can you afford to share food with your Liege Lord's house, proving your allegiance? Or will your people starve in the coming winter? Will your house guard help defend the kingdom, or will your most trusted men stay at your side?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Liege is a medieval RPG that plays like a choose your own adventure visual novel. Unlike most medieval stories however, the house you are Lord of is the smallest and least influential of the noble houses. It is up to you to make the best of tough situations if your house is to maintain its place in the noble hierarchy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scheme With Nobles and Know Your People's Woes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/adbfa7b1bad555eb3462de4b6a1b4389.poster.avif?t=1746806716\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/adbfa7b1bad555eb3462de4b6a1b4389.webm?t=1746806716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/adbfa7b1bad555eb3462de4b6a1b4389.mp4?t=1746806716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold court to receive visiting nobles from neighboring houses. Learn the plight of your peasants and hear their pleas for action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Give Commands and Choose Whom You Serve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/df2d234a427bfa67a14c767de3ea6c43.poster.avif?t=1746806716\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/df2d234a427bfa67a14c767de3ea6c43.webm?t=1746806716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/df2d234a427bfa67a14c767de3ea6c43.mp4?t=1746806716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weigh the possible courses of action and confer with your noble advisors. Listen well and consider each choice carefully. For every order you give, there will be those that praise your leadership while others that vilify your efforts. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change the World With Your Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/e85c548ca08185f262b590b082a8118a.poster.avif?t=1746806716\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/e85c548ca08185f262b590b082a8118a.webm?t=1746806716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/e85c548ca08185f262b590b082a8118a.mp4?t=1746806716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Witness how your loyal subjects execute and follow your decrees. Watch as your town grows and live with the consequences of your choices!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Yourself and Anybody Important</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/94fe7f04b4e6765435664359a41dedff.poster.avif?t=1746806716\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/94fe7f04b4e6765435664359a41dedff.webm?t=1746806716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809520/extras/94fe7f04b4e6765435664359a41dedff.mp4?t=1746806716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your family your own! My Liege has a character and house editor, allowing you to change the names and appearances of every member of your family. Want to choose your allies and foes as well? You can also customize all of the members of the other four noble houses of the Western Valley as well!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hello World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2809520/df563ccf77fae1c33d0cc1a36f374a99099a5404.jpg"},{"name":"Winter Is Coming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2809520/47a7490d00665af40a3ef970d5e7b24e0601db57.jpg"},{"name":"The Lordsmount","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2809520/7fc5ae6924f88574bbca138050bdeac3c9fcade5.jpg"},{"name":"A Tourney For Lords","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2809520/479a23909bac6d15ed6e5d410fa20623492a1985.jpg"},{"name":"The Young Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2809520/3b568deca29515a1148fe4b9e908936999f8a16f.jpg"},{"name":"A Valley Divided","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2809520/63626c0ed04c68a51763c7819c3d0259a919844e.jpg"},{"name":"A High Arm to Believe In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2809520/f511f5bc85b47ea3abc77ea0dbdecb3db50bcd93.jpg"},{"name":"Her?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2809520/d85